{"segment_id": "segment_00006", "start": 180.0, "end": 210.0, "speech": "he often dreamed of? 他经常梦想的什么事儿啊？ Who对主语提问直接踢掉，不用变一般疑问句。第五个，He bought a house in the country. Did的往前提，bought换回原形，叫 Did he buy a house in the country? Where那对in the country提问，叫 Where did he buy a house? Okay. 第六个，He went to live there. Did的提前，动词换回原形。 Where对there提问，Who对主语提问，不变一般疑问句。所以答案叫 Who", "frames": [{"path": "frames/frame_000025.webp", "time": 196.0, "ocr": {"texts": ["Asking questions", "1. Harrison is an old friend. (Who)", "2. He'd lived in the Mediterranean. (Where)", "3.He", "lived there for many years before!", "he", "returned to England.(How long) (Where)", "4. He'd often dreamed of retiring to England.", "(What) (Who)", "5. He bought a house in the country (Where)"], "scores": [0.99616, 0.96735, 0.98468, 0.99531, 0.97263, 0.99883, 0.97602, 0.97601, 0.98686, 0.95986], "boxes": [[[91.0, 135.0], [493.0, 138.0], [493.0, 202.0], [91.0, 198.0]], [[144.0, 273.0], [917.0, 279.0], [917.0, 345.0], [144.0, 338.0]], [[143.0, 353.0], [1138.0, 359.0], [1138.0, 425.0], [143.0, 419.0]], [[144.0, 441.0], [276.0, 441.0], [276.0, 501.0], [144.0, 501.0]], [[315.0, 435.0], [1096.0, 430.0], [1096.0, 505.0], [315.0, 510.0]], [[1072.0, 440.0], [1157.0, 440.0], [1157.0, 498.0], [1072.0, 498.0]], [[140.0, 502.0], [1086.0, 502.0], [1086.0, 571.0], [140.0, 571.0]], [[143.0, 578.0], [1183.0, 582.0], [1183.0, 653.0], [143.0, 649.0]], [[146.0, 647.0], [458.0, 647.0], [458.0, 708.0], [146.0, 708.0]], [[144.0, 725.0], [1165.0, 727.0], [1165.0, 792.0], [144.0, 790.0]]]}}, {"path": "frames/frame_000026.webp", "time": 200.0, "ocr": {"texts": ["Asking questions"], "scores": [0.99918], "boxes": [[[89.0, 131.0], [498.0, 136.0], [497.0, 206.0], [88.0, 200.0]]]}}], "review_flags": [], "asr_model": "Qwen/Qwen3-ASR-1.7B"}
