{"segment_id": "segment_00008", "start": 240.0, "end": 270.0, "speech": "对吧? How often did it rain? Okay.第九个, Harrison got a shock. Did提前, who对主语提问不变一般疑问句, why对整个一般疑问句提问,直接加在句首,叫做Why did Harrison get a shock? Okay.好, He sold the house.那Did he sell the house?啊, What did he sell? When did he sell the house?玩一个.最后一个, Did提前, why加整句, who替代主语就可以了啊.", "frames": [{"path": "frames/frame_000028.webp", "time": 241.0, "ocr": {"texts": ["Asking questions", "6. He went to live there.(Where) (Who)", "7. He began to complain about the weather.", "(What about) (Why) (Who)", "8. It rained continually. (How often)"], "scores": [0.98905, 0.9856, 0.97989, 0.95692, 0.9728], "boxes": [[[91.0, 135.0], [494.0, 138.0], [494.0, 201.0], [91.0, 197.0]], [[143.0, 273.0], [1039.0, 279.0], [1039.0, 345.0], [143.0, 338.0]], [[145.0, 359.0], [1161.0, 359.0], [1161.0, 425.0], [145.0, 425.0]], [[144.0, 422.0], [751.0, 424.0], [751.0, 487.0], [144.0, 485.0]], [[143.0, 500.0], [947.0, 503.0], [947.0, 568.0], [143.0, 565.0]]]}}, {"path": "frames/frame_000029.webp", "time": 256.0, "ocr": {"texts": ["Asking questions", "6. He went to live there.(Where) (Who)", "7. He began to complain about the weather.", "(What about) (Why) (Who)", "8. It rained continually. (How often)", "9. Harrison got a shock. (Who) (Why)", "10. He sold the house.(What) (When)"], "scores": [0.99383, 0.98069, 0.9843, 0.97637, 0.97755, 0.95867, 0.97729], "boxes": [[[92.0, 135.0], [494.0, 138.0], [494.0, 201.0], [92.0, 197.0]], [[143.0, 273.0], [1039.0, 279.0], [1039.0, 345.0], [143.0, 338.0]], [[146.0, 359.0], [1161.0, 359.0], [1161.0, 425.0], [146.0, 425.0]], [[144.0, 422.0], [751.0, 424.0], [751.0, 486.0], [144.0, 484.0]], [[144.0, 502.0], [947.0, 502.0], [947.0, 568.0], [144.0, 568.0]], [[142.0, 582.0], [985.0, 584.0], [985.0, 652.0], [142.0, 650.0]], [[145.0, 661.0], [1004.0, 665.0], [1004.0, 731.0], [145.0, 727.0]]]}}, {"path": "frames/frame_000030.webp", "time": 269.0, "ocr": {"texts": ["Tell the story", "训练目标：", "口语复述能力", "Accura