{"segment_id": "segment_00009", "start": 270.0, "end": 300.0, "speech": "tell the story，口语复述，呃，还是那句话，再提一下各位，第一单元我已经做了大量的这个示范啊，您如果没有看，那不妨过去看一下，行吧？第二单元我们就不示范了。那这个地方呢，提一句叫做各位，文章读的很熟了之后，不用把它完全背下来，所以您不用特别管说我接下来复述是不是完全正确的呢？不用做这个担心，但你要足够的流畅，对吧？好，OK，呃，那看着这些关键", "frames": [{"path": "frames/frame_000031.webp", "time": 288.0, "ocr": {"texts": ["Tell the story", "训练目标：", "口语复述能力", "Accuracy", "Fluency"], "scores": [0.96304, 0.95161, 0.92577, 0.97818, 0.99955], "boxes": [[[92.0, 132.0], [406.0, 141.0], [404.0, 201.0], [90.0, 192.0]], [[145.0, 282.0], [380.0, 280.0], [380.0, 340.0], [145.0, 343.0]], [[149.0, 344.0], [453.0, 344.0], [453.0, 408.0], [149.0, 408.0]], [[17.0, 506.0], [233.0, 512.0], [231.0, 577.0], [15.0, 571.0]], [[628.0, 503.0], [818.0, 515.0], [814.0, 573.0], [624.0, 561.0]]]}}, {"path": "frames/frame_000032.webp", "time": 296.0, "ocr": {"texts": ["Tell the story", "① old friend - Mediterranean - many years -", "returned", "dreamed of returning - settle down", "no sooner - house - live there", "immediately - complain - weather", "summer - rained - cold", "⑥ so many- sunshine- shock", ") acted as if - never - England", "③ In the end - more - could bear", "8", "⑨ hardly - settle down - sold - left"], "scores": [0.93648, 0.97765, 0.99989, 0.9851, 0.97211, 0.97608, 0.94535, 0.96364, 0.94592, 0.9535, 0.99941, 0.94004], "boxes": [[[94.0, 131.0], [404.0, 142.0], [402.0, 202.0], [92.0, 192.0]], [[145.0, 275.0], [1169.0, 282.0], [1169.0, 347.0], [145.0, 339.0]], [[228.0, 358.0], [442.0, 354.0], [443.0, 411.0], [229.0, 414.0]], [[228.0, 425.0], [1042.0, 425.0], [1042.0, 493.0], [228.0, 493.0]], [[223.0, 503.0], [908.0, 501.0], [908.0, 564.0], [223.0, 566.0]], [[225.0, 578.0], [1007.0, 580.0], [1007.0, 642.0], [225.0, 640.0]], [[226.0, 654.0], [757.0, 651.0], [757.0, 711.0], [226.0, 714.0]], [[141.0, 723.0], [854.0, 725.0], [854.0, 797.0], [141.0, 795.0]], [[190.0, 802.0], [875.0, 802.0], [875.0, 868.0], [190.0, 868.0]], [[177.0, 877.0], [926.0, 877.0], [926.0, 938.0], [177.