{"segment_id": "segment_00010", "start": 300.0, "end": 330.0, "speech": "词就可以了。然后 summary writing 呢，是我们练习我们写作的复述能力。呃，各位写完摘要写作了之后，来这个地方去写一下啊。呃，这些最基本的点练习一下就可以了。有问题，视频下方留言告诉我们，好吧？然后 topic for discussion，这是老习惯，对于各位来说最难的一件事情，就是我们学英语一直学一直学，学到最后，希望能做到的事情，就是用英文的单词、语法、习惯用法去张嘴跟别人聊这些", "frames": [{"path": "frames/frame_000033.webp", "time": 301.0, "ocr": {"texts": ["Summary writing: Key", "训练目标：", "写作复述能力"], "scores": [0.97166, 0.98299, 0.99982], "boxes": [[[54.0, 132.0], [568.0, 139.0], [567.0, 203.0], [53.0, 195.0]], [[108.0, 333.0], [343.0, 333.0], [343.0, 394.0], [108.0, 394.0]], [[108.0, 396.0], [415.0, 396.0], [415.0, 460.0], [108.0, 460.0]]]}}, {"path": "frames/frame_000034.webp", "time": 305.0, "ocr": {"texts": ["Summary writing: Key", "The writer's friend, Harrison, had spent many", "years in the Mediterranean, but he wanted to", "retire in England so he bought a house in the", "country. The summer that year was very bad", "and he complained about the weather. In the", "end Harrison not only sold the house but", "also left the country."], "scores": [0.99702, 0.98892, 0.97653, 0.97451, 0.9843, 0.98525, 0.99453, 0.98065], "boxes": [[[53.0, 129.0], [568.0, 134.0], [567.0, 204.0], [52.0, 198.0]], [[104.0, 321.0], [1137.0, 332.0], [1137.0, 403.0], [104.0, 393.0]], [[100.0, 394.0], [1142.0, 386.0], [1142.0, 454.0], [100.0, 463.0]], [[103.0, 457.0], [1141.0, 454.0], [1141.0, 516.0], [103.0, 519.0]], [[104.0, 516.0], [1118.0, 513.0], [1118.0, 582.0], [104.0, 585.0]], [[104.0, 579.0], [1139.0, 576.0], [1139.0, 637.0], [104.0, 640.0]], [[105.0, 639.0], [1051.0, 639.0], [1051.0, 701.0], [105.0, 701.0]], [[107.0, 695.0], [572.0, 707.0], [571.0, 767.0], [106.0, 755.0]]]}}, {"path": "frames/frame_000035.webp", "time": 315.0, "ocr": {"texts": ["Topics for discussion", "训练目标：", "完全自由的对话", "Accuracy", "Fluency"], "scores": [0.99798, 0.98404, 0.99965, 0.99904, 0.99953], "boxes": [[[57.0, 137.0], [560.0, 137.0], [560.0, 197.0], [57.0, 197.0]], [[108.0, 333.0], [343.0, 333.0], [343.0, 39